From 6087072b61f0be7774cf095610043fa9068390f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: netplay <netplay@localhost>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:42:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] netplay: fixes from independent review

- CTRL carries a magic word; rings cleared with never-valid words (a zero
  word decoded as CRC[0] = 0)
- a new session waits for the core to report IDLE before arming
- only OSD slot 1 starts a session; ROM reload keeps opensave so .sav loads
- recording saved on ROM change; NPR2 stores the delay, replay uses it
- debug dots in the settings check; peer CRCs kept during START wait;
  INPUT frame-number wrap rejected
- tests for each of the above
